<title>CANADA: Canada Aug new motor vehicle sales rise 0.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada Aug new motor vehicle sales rise 0.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>New motor vehicle sales rose 0.7 percent seasonally adjusted in August to 97,271 units from a revised 96,562 units in July, Statistics Canada said on Thursday.</p>
<p>A Reuters survey of economists had forecast a 1.8 percent rise in August.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745</p>
</text>
